{"id":"n38474-1-8","stage":5,"title":"기특하다 · 乖","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38474-1-8-1","ko":"엄마, 설거지는 제가 할게요.","zh":"妈妈，洗碗我来做吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"설거지는","meaning":"刷碗，洗碗","explanation":"설거지：刷碗，洗碗；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"설거지","audio":"/audio/43618b069071a4b4692e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62246","senseId":"1","lemma":"설거지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할게요.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"43618b069071a4b4","term":"설거지","zh":"刷碗，洗碗","audio":"/audio/43618b069071a4b4692e.mp3","entryId":"62246","definition":"用餐后刷洗并整理餐具。","pronunciation":["설거지"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/86f609ff9088d373bbad.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n38474-1-8-2","ko":"아유, 요 기특한 녀석을 다 봤나.","zh":"哎呀，看看这多懂事的孩子啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아유,","